{"quest_id": 6299, "name": "黄泉の門", "description": "妖天君と屍解仙。命を弄ぶ邪仙が\n堕姫を粛清せんと襲い来る。邪仙が操りし\n猛者を打ち倒し、堕姫の身を守り抜け！\n神級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv50）", "event": "傾国の妖狐と誘惑されし王子", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920099, "map_no": 5267, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 10000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 1100, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 110.0, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2105280, "race_id": 4, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 2, "missile_id": 85, "missile": {"slow": [99, 0]}, "master_id": 629, "global_id": 628, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 627, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 25000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 25000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 1100, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 111, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2105264, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 628, "global_id": 627, "from_condition": 2}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 25000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 25000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 400, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_range": 210, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2109728, "special_effect_id": 142, "missile_id": 194, "missile": {"speed": 15.0}, "master_id": 30210, "global_id": 3829, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 19, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 220.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105120, "race_id": 14, "change_to": 4, "change_condition": 5, "master_id": 602, "global_id": 601, "to_condition": 5, "to_global_id": 602, "spawn_sec": 7}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 2500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105136, "race_id": 14, "master_id": 603, "global_id": 602, "from_condition": 5}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 45000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 45000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 500, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 30, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 91, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2106736, "special_effect_id": 229, "missile_id": 6, "master_id": 855, "global_id": 854, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 60}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 3500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2106672, "master_id": 842, "global_id": 841, "spawn_sec": 66}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 3500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 54, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2108080, "master_id": 991, "global_id": 990, "spawn_sec": 103}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 6000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 186, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2106688, "master_id": 849, "global_id": 848, "spawn_sec": 144}, {"enemy_id": 10, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 54, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2108096, "master_id": 992, "global_id": 991, "spawn_sec": 169}, {"enemy_id": 11, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 2, "hp": 10000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 400, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 116, "move_speed": 220.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2105152, "race_id": 14, "change_to": 11, "change_condition": 5, "master_id": 604, "global_id": 603, "to_condition": 5, "to_global_id": 604, "spawn_sec": 193}, {"enemy_id": 11, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 10000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 400, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 116, "move_speed": 2500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2105168, "race_id": 14, "master_id": 605, "global_id": 604, "from_condition": 5}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "堕姫", "text": "……確かこの辺りだったはずじゃ。\n調子に乗って彼岸花を沢山バラ撒いてしまったのは。", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "さほど強力ではないとはいえ、\nあの彼岸花には誘惑の術の効果が乗り移っておる。\n邪仙どもに悪用される前に少しでも回収せんと……。", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "妖天君", "text": "――ふふ。堕姫、来ると思ってたヨ。", "face": "l6656443f354e"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "ひぃッ！？　その声は――妖天君！\nそれに、隣におるのは屍解仙か！\nまさか、わらわを始末しに……？", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "カッカッカ……なにを驚いておる？\nぬしのように邪仙郷の掟に背いた者が\n粛清されるのは自明の理であろう？", "face": "l42c7d035b5ff"}, {"name": "妖天君", "text": "キミにはボクたちの面子を随分潰されたからネェ。\n裏切り者に相応しい凄惨な死を迎えさせてあげるヨ！", "face": "l6656443f354e"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "あわわ……も、もうおしまいじゃぁ……。\nあぁ、王子……死ぬ前にもう一度会いたかった……。", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "――のわっ！？\nお……王子！？　なぜ斯様な場所に……？", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "よかった、間に合ったようですね。\n堕姫さんが一人で華の国へ向かったという\n噂を聞いて、急いで飛んできて正解でした。"}, {"name": "妖天君", "text": "全く……目障りな奴らだネェ。\nそんなに死んじゃいたいなら、\n邪仙郷有数の術者が三人で相手してやるヨ！", "face": "l6656443f354e"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "三人……？\n妖天君と屍解仙の他に誰かいるというのでしょうか？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "詳細は不明ですが、十分に警戒してまいりましょう。\n王子、ご指示をお願いします！", "face": "lfd3f42c51a24"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 115, "lines": [{"name": "妖天君", "text": "……そろそろ頃合いかねェ。\n屍解仙、準備はできたカイ？", "face": "l6656443f354e"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "カッカッカ！　勿論ですとも！", "face": "l42c7d035b5ff"}, {"name": "妖天君", "text": "ホホっ、いい返事だネェ！\nそれじゃあ、そろそろ登場してもらうとしヨウ。\n邪仙郷の異端と呼ばれた、あの男にネ――ホホイっ！", "face": "l6656443f354e"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 120, "lines": [{"name": "妖虎仙", "text": "……グ……ヴォオォォッ……！！", "face": "l2cbafd1d65bb"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あれは……妖虎仙！\n屍解仙に殺められたはずでは……。", "face": "lfd3f42c51a24"}, {"name": "妖天君", "text": "魂パクを自在に操るボクの落魂陣。\nその力を甘く見られちゃ困るネェ！", "face": "l6656443f354e"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "妖虎仙……生前は目障りとしか思わなんだが、\n死後の魂を弄され、戦わされるとは難儀よのぅ。\n今こそ邪仙郷の為、存分に力を振るうがよい！", "face": "l42c7d035b5ff"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "妖天君", "text": "くっ……せっかく操った妖虎仙を。\nキミたち、本当に邪魔ばかりしてくれるネェ！", "face": "l6656443f354e"}, {"name": "妖天君", "text": "まぁ、いいサ……無駄に戦力を費やすのは\n通天教主様の望むところじゃないだろうし、\n今日のところは撤退させてもらうヨ。", "face": "l6656443f354e"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "はわわ……こ、怖かったのじゃ……。\nすまぬ、皆の衆……。\nわらわ、助けてもらってばかりじゃのぅ。", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "ユリアン", "text": "まったくだぜ。\n危険なことは判ってんのに、\nどうして一人でこんなところまで来やがったんだよ？", "face": "u7"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "う……す、すまぬ。\n赤い彼岸花を各地に撒いたのはわらわじゃから、\n邪仙たちに悪用される前に自分で回収したくての……。", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "気持ちはわかりますけど……。\n今後はこのようなことが起きないように\n単独行動はなるべく控えてくださいね？"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "赤い彼岸花の収集なら、私たちも手伝いますから。"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "お……王子。\nおぬしもわらわに、一人で行動するなと申すのか？", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "（く……ふふっ……くふふふふっ♪\nそこまで言われては仕方ないのぅ～。\nもう一生おぬしから離れぬぞ、王子ぃ～っ♪）", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ふふっ。堕姫さん、なんだか嬉しそうですね。\nそれでは、帰還いたしましょう。"}]}], "active": true}